 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Your Leo friend wore gold sequins to your wedding. Sofia is not the bride. You are.",
   "from": 0,
   "to": 129
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "That's Sofia. Generous, loud and always glowing.",
   "from": 132,
   "to": 215
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "She brought her own ring light to the ceremony.",
   "from": 218,
   "to": 290
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "During the vows she fixed her hair in a trumpet.",
   "from": 294,
   "to": 364
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Then she gives the toast and it's mostly about her.",
   "from": 368,
   "to": 444
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "speaker": "sofia",
   "text": "And that's how the bride met her best friend. Me!",
   "from": 448,
   "to": 559
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "The crowd loves it. Sofia is winning.",
   "from": 563,
   "to": 625
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Then the lights go down for the first dance.",
   "from": 629,
   "to": 686
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "One spotlight comes on. It lands on the bride.",
   "from": 689,
   "to": 763
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Sofia stands in the dark for the first time ever.",
   "from": 767,
   "to": 841
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "speaker": "sofia",
   "text": "Excuse me? Is this thing broken?",
   "from": 844,
   "to": 900
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "So what's going on inside a Leo?",
   "from": 903,
   "to": 960
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Picture a theater with one switch marked SPOTLIGHT. It only points one way at her.",
   "from": 963,
   "to": 1107
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Backstage an applause meter must stay in the red.",
   "from": 1110,
   "to": 1177
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "There's a mirror labelled MAIN and one labelled BACKUP.",
   "from": 1180,
   "to": 1266
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "And a big heart with a sign that says GENEROUS.",
   "from": 1270,
   "to": 1341
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Because Leos love big and they pay for everyone's drinks.",
   "from": 1345,
   "to": 1419
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "So Sofia walks into the light to dance with the bride.",
   "from": 1422,
   "to": 1516
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "She trips on the dress and lands in the cake.",
   "from": 1519,
   "to": 1584
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "text": "Somehow it's the best photo of the night.",
   "from": 1587,
   "to": 1649
  }
 ],
